// What everything is worth, in whole coins (`townsfolk` design 6), and the
// group a town's need for it is read by (`trade.ron`).
//
// APPEND-ONLY, like the goods table: never drop or rename a row; retune a
// value in place, add a new item as a new row at the end. A test
// (`pbd_core::economy` tests) fails while any good, block, tool or fish the
// game knows has no row, and while a row shipped before is missing.
